'''HNK Vukovar 1991''' is a professional [[Croatia]]n [[association football|football]] club based in [[Vukovar]]. The club currently plays in the [[First Football League (Croatia)|First Football League]], the second tier of [[Croatian football league system|Croatian football]], following relegation from the [[2025–26 Croatian Football League]]."}}
